Fix webmail login failing with "An internal error has occurred" on the PHP 8.5 image. Mailu enables snuffleupagus' `sp.global_strict`, which compiles every file as though it declared `strict_types=1`, and two call sites are not type-correct under that rule: the roundcube and SnappyMail SSO plugins passed the HTTP status code as `header()`'s second argument, which is `bool $replace`, and roundcube's `rcube_db::quote()` hands an integer straight to `PDO::quote()`, which declares a string -- so `rcube_user::touch()` aborted every login. The plugins are fixed and roundcube is patched during the build; roundcube has the same code in 1.6.19 and on master, its PHP 8.5 work being on the 1.7 line.
